    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d825-a3">

                <pb facs="1047" n="933" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg933"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Chilean Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Barros</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-19">March 19, 1931</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 587</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Confirming my oral request of
                    yesterday, I have the honor to request an investigation of the criminal
                    proceedings which were instituted on or about March 17th in your courts against
                    Mr. L. K. Bethune, Manager of the General Motors Acceptance Corporation.</p>
                <p>I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. S. Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
